--   2. proverbs-21-the-kings-heart-is-in-the-hand-of-yahuah — Tanakh (Proverbs, Ezra, Daniel, Isaiah) + NT (Romans, John, Acts) [free] (the Father turns the heart even of pagan kings; the sovereign over rulers)
